    <h2 class="text-left"><strong>Residence Halls (Dormitories)</strong></h2>
   <p><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1596276020587-8044fe049813?q=80&w=939&auto=format&fit=crop&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&ixid=M3wxMjA3fDB8MHxwaG90by1wYWdlfHx8fGVufDB8fHx8fA%3D%3D" class="fr-fic fr-fil fr-dii m-2" style="width: 250px ; height: auto">
    The student village, located at the North of the Academia, is divided into two mains parts: The Diurnal Village and Nocturnal Village, reserved for, respectively, Day Time students and Night Time students. Sometimes they are shortened to Day and Night dorms to make it easier.
<br>All Day buildings have a name referencing the parts of the day, while the Night ones reference the phases of the Moon.

    <br><br><strong>Diurnal Village buildings:</strong> Dawn, Sunrise, Morning, Midday, Afternoon, Sunset, Dusk
    <br><strong>Nocturnal Village buildings:</strong> New Moon, Crescent Moon, Quarter Moon, Gibbous Moon and Full Moon

<br><br>There is a single building reserved for inter-circadian meetings, called the Eclipse Hall, so monsters of all time of a day can meet at the middle of their villages.
<br>Near the stadiums are visitor teams dorms in case they need to stay for multiple days.</p>
